Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# NOTE: data/dataset.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the corpus every
# result in the paper is computed over; the repository is not reproducible
# without it. Likewise reports/ is tracked: the cached model outputs under
# reports/labeler/ and reports/flow_judge/ let the scoring be re-run without
# spending API calls.
